# The digital face shows the date the test watch starts at, and the next one a day later.
# Each digit of its time is a label of its own, so the time is checked by eye in the screenshot.
open face digital
expect text "Mon 5 Jan 2026"

wait 24h
expect text "Tue 6 Jan 2026"
expect no text "Mon 5 Jan 2026"
expect no failures
screenshot digital_face.png
